{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0464_1000_014mir", "source_sha256": "9877eea4df1bcbe1b9712385e0021683a5f9102d5b597c1776cb15e69b22e8c5", "ja": "ようやく姿を見せましたね。この事件の犯人は……\n{$P$}さん、あなたです。", "zh": "你终于现身了呢。这起事件的犯人就是……\n{$P$}先生，是你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0464_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0d1827d4b5beee0c963da248922a63f3c0f18788014c0d985e4f91dcc3fbc19e", "ja": "な、なんだって！？\n……えーと、本当に何の話だ？", "zh": "什、什么！？\n……呃，这到底是在说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0464_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "439dfd55ee5fb130bf3ba42708a084b38edbc348b353e72f36660b9428bc7f58", "ja": "……えへへ。ごめんなさい、\nこの台詞が言いたかっただけなんです！", "zh": "……嘿嘿。对不起，\n我只是想说这句台词而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0464_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9516f936a6e6cf5bf25699b55ee9a5345ec55c79dcfe195c1b243710d841afbb", "ja": "ああ、そういうことか。\nいきなり犯人にされて、何事かと思ったよ。", "zh": "啊，原来是这么回事。\n突然被当成犯人，我还以为发生什么事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0464_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "3612c9184cc5a3fb4716514214aba05cce447118a5d58343363f2341da0bbd19", "ja": "はい♪　衣装に着替えたら、\nなんだかスイッチが入っちゃって……。", "zh": "好的♪换好服装后，不知怎么就进入状态了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0464_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "7f4e77cca530a8e71f3f9a06127d42a0778a81985f2a18261428448864b158a9", "ja": "私、すっごく好きなんですよ！\n刑事ドラマとかで、犯人を追い詰めるところ♪", "zh": "我超级喜欢这个！\n就是刑侦剧里把犯人逼入绝境的那种场面♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0464_1006_p", "source_sha256": "886ce910679ae31a258990f17aeb8417becea196705341c1ba9596c9b93906fa", "ja": "推理モノの、一番の見せ場だもんな。\n今回の映画でも大事なシーンだし。", "zh": "推理作品最精彩的地方嘛。\n这也是这次电影中的重要场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0464_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3278ded1cafb86d767c65c5860e89864627cc4132f076c0fc41c205337c7ffe9", "ja": "そういう意味では、さっきの演技はすごく\nよかったと思う。未来の迫力に押されたからな！", "zh": "从这个意义上说，我觉得刚才的演技非常棒。因为被未来的气势压倒了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0464_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "55def2c4b1c0eff00fad450ce4bfa3420cc4611f640340b2639ada4cbc7e76c7", "ja": "本当ですか？　ありがとうございまーす♪\nカッコイイ刑事さんになれそうな気がしてきました！", "zh": "真的吗？谢谢你——♪\n我觉得自己好像能成为一名帅气的刑警了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0464_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "933094b488f2c14bd8cb477291506610f963afe490bef44746de74b9177c5151", "ja": "私が、推理して、犯人を見つけてみせますから。\n何か事件があったら、任せてくださいっ！", "zh": "我会推理，找出犯人的。\n要是有什么案子，就交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0464_1010_p", "source_sha256": "2e43294464d87101cb8ed0f15804f01206cd0b1b8101beb5f85a80adba9c99b8", "ja": "まぁ事件なんて、そうそう起こらない……あ、待てよ。\nちょうど、未来に相談したい事件があるな。", "zh": "嘛，案件这种事也不是随随便便就会发生的……啊，等等。\n正好，有件事想找未来商量一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0464_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "a098aa004ad0dd524805df12aa043214ab4f281044e2f3fc1ac0dc84ec47167f", "ja": "えっ。なんですか？\nもしかして、さ、殺人事件……！？", "zh": "诶，什么事？\n难道是、是杀人事件……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0464_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "0190a3a0cbb661aa2b73dac517f3e2e0595407c1e88e66e40ad80d9b07d42be9", "ja": "{$P$}さん、詳しく聞かせて\nください。私がズバッと解決しちゃいますから！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，请跟我详细说说吧。\n我一定会漂亮地解决掉的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0464_1013_p", "source_sha256": "800fbe8027932e080acd9e21734fba384669bc2eb37f55be5c1a1b7424e68b3c", "ja": "ああ……。実は昨夜、劇場の見回りをしていたら、\nなんとレッスンルームの鍵が開けっぱなしだったんだ。", "zh": "啊……其实昨晚我巡视剧场时，发现练习室的门竟然一直没锁。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0464_1014_p", "source_sha256": "70f1958e71461a1be83b27361a9a24a1109c8e742e5c703e53a3f3ba524a553c", "ja": "最後に出る人が施錠するルールのはずなんだが……。\n未来にこの謎が解けるかな？", "zh": "按规定应该是最后离开的人负责锁门……。\n未来，你能解开这个谜吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0464_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "6c62295fb794dbe73b2fbe72cd427619b7bd71326e92c011b624655d67568190", "ja": "そんなの簡単ですよ！　つまり、\n鍵を閉め忘れた人を探せばいいんですよね？", "zh": "那很简单啊！也就是说，\n只要找出忘记锁门的人就行了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0464_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "c399d71606b7939903f1c893833558c0215e123b1da0a04aa156a45a8756d9c5", "ja": "えっと、昨日は、琴葉ちゃんと風花さんと私で、\n遅くまでレッスンルームにいて……。", "zh": "那个，昨天我和琴叶、小风花一起待在练习室里，直到很晚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0464_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "0ed1f36844a8b4330ad215982e86c5c9196e66831f9e8a429ef744d01e1c5738", "ja": "3人で帰ろうってなって、私が忘れ物に気づいて、\n取りに戻って……あれ？　ということは……。", "zh": "正当我们3个人准备回去的时候，我发现自己落了东西，\n就回去拿……咦？这么说的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0464_1018_p", "source_sha256": "5a04c3b9ccf195f95403bdaddf1283e25ca4a4838680d2934a9205cc68146861", "ja": "そう、部屋の鍵を閉め忘れた犯人は……\n未来、お前だ！　今後、気を付けるように。", "zh": "没错，忘记锁房门的犯人就是……未来，是你！以后可要注意了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0464_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0464_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "30ee4136ac8b9c1cf74c48facae0d554d424a948af481ca93d2fae3719c8059c", "ja": "ごめんなさ～い！\n刑事のつもりが、犯人になっちゃいました……でへへ。", "zh": "对不起啦～！\n本来想当刑警，结果却变成犯人了……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
